      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SKEDADDLE BENNY (2) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 4.5 lengths at this track in a handy 20.44. Draws to advantage and has a good record over this journey. Well placed and can measure up. FANCY BELLA (1) broke a string of placings finishing in the money two on end before a last start fifth (22.70) at Bulli. Form at the trip sound including four wins. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Great chance to atone. ZIPPING MARIE (7) is a fast dog well performed over the sprint races. Kept coming to finish sixth over 400m at The Gardens (23.72) latest in a Grade 5. Has a strong winning record at this journey including four wins. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. FRENCH REVOLVER (3) cannot be left out despite coming off a short break.",
